# armour/shared/pauldron_crystal5_r: the great CRYSTAL pauldron on the right shoulder (crystal.5; FORGE-MANTLE, the envelope: PLAN "The envelope", STYLE_P2 29).
# faceted crystal points standing out of a banded cop, the tallest 4 px over it, each point a clean 2 px plane;
# a gilt rim and a hanging lame under the band (the envelope's great / legend size; STARFALL, starmetal).
# 5 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (26 across with its pair); the side views the large
# size's width + 1, hanging lower. Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`).
# Finish regions: R the gilt rims, G the tallest point's glint, N the seam under the band, P the points and the band.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-MANTLE gen56.py from shapes56.py (re-run, never
# hand-edit the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron crystal.5
layer armNear
